# Docker matches these against the context-relative path, so a bare `.env`
# covers ONLY the repo root — unlike .gitignore, where it is recursive.
# packages/api/.env exists on disk and `COPY packages/api packages/api` was
# pulling it into the build stage, where prisma.config.ts's `dotenv/config`
# then loaded it and overrode the placeholder DATABASE_URL during
# `prisma generate`.
